OL,3,GNEWSAShops to become homes as city
OL,4,Acontinues to change
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former city store will be turned into
OL,7,F70 flats, with experts predicting
OL,8,Ffurther similar transformations to
OL,9,Fvacant shops, due to changing shopping
OL,10,Fhabits.
OL,12,FNorwich City Council officers have
OL,13,Fapproved an application to change the
OL,14,Fuse of the former Wilko and Poundland
OL,15,Fstores on the corner of St Stephens
OL,16,FStreet.
OL,18,FDeveloper, ALB Group, said it would
OL,19,Fturn an "underutilised space that
OL,20,Freflects badly" on the city into an
OL,21,F"urban living experience."
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
